WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.250
FlowSight, by Manuel Castillejo.

2
00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.030
Your app in ninety seconds.

3
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.010
Name a task, set your goal, and

4
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:10.290
track time. Choose normal timing or Pomodoro,

5
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.990
then adjust work and breaks.

6
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.300
Describe tasks and available time.

7
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.560
Local AI proposes blocks.

8
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.460
Adjust your plan, then confirm before adding it.

9
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.120
Pair the extension for Total Focus.

10
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.540
Choose blocked sites, exceptions and duration, with

11
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.360
