26
00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.400
Control sync, AI, analytics, exclusions and retention.

27
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.180
Export or erase data.

28
00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.420
External AI gets reports you request.

29
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.220
Join private leagues for focus points.

30
00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.060
Work details stay private.

31
00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.280
Adjust startup, tray, language, theme and updates.

32
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.420
Explore FlowSight at flowsight dot site.

33
